  <title>Install the toolkit</title>
  <updated>2026-10-19T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
  <author><name>DocKitty Example</name></author>
  <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://spec-kitty.github.io/doc-kitty/guides/install/"/>
  <summary>Install @spec-kitty/doc-toolkit 0.4.0 from GitHub Packages with its Astro 7 and Starlight 0.42 peers, wire it into a new site, and build it.</summary>
  <content type="html">&lt;span id=&quot;install-the-toolkit&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This guide is for a project that &lt;strong&gt;uses&lt;/strong&gt; DocKitty: you want your own
documentation site built from the published &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;@spec-kitty/doc-toolkit&lt;/code&gt; package.
It covers release 0.4.0. Every step matches the consumption-test fixture that CI
builds from the packed package on every change, and a test keeps this page in
line with that fixture and with the package’s declared requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Upgrading a site from toolkit 0.3? Read the
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/spec-kitty/doc-kitty/blob/main/docs/migrations/0.3-to-0.4.md&quot;&gt;0.3 to 0.4 migration guide&lt;/a&gt;
first: 0.4.0 moves to Astro 7 and Starlight 0.42 and removes what 0.3.0
deprecated.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-you-need&quot;&gt;What you need&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Node &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&gt;=22.22.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, the toolkit’s &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;engines.node&lt;/code&gt; floor, locally and in
every CI job that builds the site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;pnpm&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;corepack enable&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A GitHub token with the &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;read:packages&lt;/code&gt; scope.&lt;/strong&gt; The toolkit is published
to the GitHub Packages npm registry, which never serves a package anonymously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The toolkit declares these peers. Your project installs them:&lt;/p&gt;





























&lt;table&gt;&lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Peer&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Range the toolkit accepts&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;astro&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&gt;=7.2.10 &amp;#x3C;8&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;@astrojs/starlight&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&gt;=0.42.0 &amp;#x3C;0.43.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;@astrojs/markdown-remark&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&gt;=7.3.0 &amp;#x3C;8&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;@astrojs/markdown-satteri&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;0.4.4&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;starlight-openapi&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;0.27.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The last two are optional. Install them only to publish OpenAPI reference pages
(see the &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/spec-kitty/doc-kitty/blob/main/docs/guides/openapi-reference.md&quot;&gt;OpenAPI how-to&lt;/a&gt;).
The install command below leaves them out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;1-point-the-spec-kitty-scope-at-github-packages&quot;&gt;1. Point the &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;@spec-kitty&lt;/code&gt; scope at GitHub Packages&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Two &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.npmrc&lt;/code&gt; files, because pnpm expands &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;${GITHUB_TOKEN}&lt;/code&gt; only in the
user-level one. The project file holds no secret; commit it:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;expressive-code&quot;&gt;&lt;figure class=&quot;frame not-content&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;pre data-language=&quot;ini&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#919F9F;--1:#5F636F&quot;&gt;# &amp;#x3C;project&gt;/.npmrc — commit this&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;@spec-kitty:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE&quot;&gt;registry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;=https://npm.pkg.github.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;expressive-code&quot;&gt;&lt;figure class=&quot;frame not-content&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;pre data-language=&quot;ini&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#919F9F;--1:#5F636F&quot;&gt;# ~/.npmrc — the credential; never commit this&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;//npm.pkg.github.com/:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE&quot;&gt;_authToken&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;=${GITHUB_TOKEN}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In GitHub Actions, use &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;actions/setup-node&lt;/code&gt; with
&lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;registry-url: https://npm.pkg.github.com&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;scope: &apos;@spec-kitty&apos;&lt;/code&gt;, pass the
workflow token as &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;NODE_AUTH_TOKEN&lt;/code&gt;, and grant &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;permissions: packages: read&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;2-install-the-toolkit-and-its-peers&quot;&gt;2. Install the toolkit and its peers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;expressive-code&quot;&gt;&lt;figure class=&quot;frame is-terminal not-content&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;sr-only&quot;&gt;Terminal window&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;pre data-language=&quot;sh&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;pnpm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;add&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;@spec-kitty/doc-toolkit@0.6.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;astro@^7.4.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;@astrojs/starlight@^0.42.6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;@astrojs/markdown-remark@^7.3.3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;@astrojs/sitemap&lt;/code&gt; comes with the toolkit as a regular dependency, so you do
not add it yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;401 Unauthorized&lt;/code&gt; usually means the &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;_authToken&lt;/code&gt; line sits in the project
&lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.npmrc&lt;/code&gt; (pnpm ignores it there), the token lacks &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;read:packages&lt;/code&gt;, or your
account cannot read the package.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;3-wire-the-integrations-in-astroconfigmjs&quot;&gt;3. Wire the integrations in &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;astro.config.mjs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;expressive-code&quot;&gt;&lt;figure class=&quot;frame not-content&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;pre data-language=&quot;js&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE&quot;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; { defineConfig } &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE&quot;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111&quot;&gt;&apos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#984E4D&quot;&gt;astro/config&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111&quot;&gt;&apos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE&quot;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; { defineDocKittyIntegrations } &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE&quot;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111&quot;&gt;&apos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#984E4D&quot;&gt;@spec-kitty/doc-toolkit/config&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111&quot;&gt;&apos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE&quot;&gt;const &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;SITE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111&quot;&gt;&apos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#984E4D&quot;&gt;https://you.example.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111&quot;&gt;&apos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE&quot;&gt;const &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;BASE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111&quot;&gt;&apos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#984E4D&quot;&gt;/docs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111&quot;&gt;&apos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#919F9F;--1:#5D6376&quot;&gt;// drop `base` when you deploy at the domain root&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE&quot;&gt;export&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE&quot;&gt;default&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;defineConfig&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;({&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;indent&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;site: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;SITE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;indent&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;base: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;BASE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;indent&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;integrations: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;defineDocKittyIntegrations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;({&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;indent&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;title: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111&quot;&gt;&apos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#984E4D&quot;&gt;My Docs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111&quot;&gt;&apos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;indent&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;description: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111&quot;&gt;&apos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#984E4D&quot;&gt;What this documentation set is.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111&quot;&gt;&apos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;indent&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;base: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;BASE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#919F9F;--1:#5D6376&quot;&gt;// must equal the `base` above&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;indent&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;markua: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#FF6A83;--1:#A24848&quot;&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;indent&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;}),&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;});&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do not set &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;markdown.processor&lt;/code&gt; yourself: the toolkit sets it, and remark or
rehype plugins you add through &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;markdown.remarkPlugins&lt;/code&gt; keep working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;4-declare-the-collections-in-srccontentconfigts&quot;&gt;4. Declare the collections in &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;src/content.config.ts&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;expressive-code&quot;&gt;&lt;figure class=&quot;frame not-content&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;pre data-language=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE&quot;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; { defineCollection } &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE&quot;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111&quot;&gt;&apos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#984E4D&quot;&gt;astro:content&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111&quot;&gt;&apos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE&quot;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;indent&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;docKittyDocsSchema,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;indent&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;docKittyDocsLoader,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;indent&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt;docKittyBibliography